	(uuid "750b9daa-41dd-56c5-9f5a-d72810cdc070")
	(paper "A1")
	(title_block
		(title "24 V level inputs: 2.2k + TLP291-4 (decision 0003 2.2 receiver rules)")
		(date "2026-11-15")
		(rev "A")
		(comment 1 "Each input: connector net -> 2.2k -> optocoupler LED -> 0 V, 1N4148W anti-parallel. Load about 10 mA at 24 V (<= 15 mA), on at >= 18 V, off at <= 2.4 V, no pull-up")
		(comment 2 "Optocoupler output: collector +3V3, emitter -> 10k to 0 V -> Pico. ESTOP_RET / ILOCK_RET are the return legs of the bank-owned safety loops (0003 4.6)")
		(comment 3 "SW_OK senses +24V_SW itself; ALM_IN is pulled up by 4.7k (the drive alarm output is open collector, conducting = healthy)")
	)
