	(text "Polarity: *_M = 1 when the 24 V input is high.  ALM_M = 1 means the drive output is OPEN (alarm / drive unpowered).\nV48_OK: 24 V level from an a-type auxiliary contact of KM3 (the 48 V contactor); the power unit must supply it (open item)."
